# SKYWELL: shots break clouds (and fly on), set crates and rocks crumbling,
# and knock cogs out of coin blocks. Lightning shots leave clouds alone.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat plat 1 90 -60 2
wait 5
cheat pos 96 -12
wait 2
hold UP+B 12
expect count_1 == 0
cheat plat 2 90 -60 2
hold UP+B 4
wait 14
expect count_2 == 0
cheat plat 5 90 -60 2
hold UP+B 30
expect coins > 0
cheat give 5
cheat plat 1 20 -60 2
cheat pos 26 -12
wait 2
hold UP+B 20
expect count_1 == 1
